# Claims ledger: tpe-pres (draft, round 1)

Files: drafts/tpe-pres.nodes.ts, drafts/tpe-pres-detail.info.ts. Generated and machine-checked: every quote fragment below was found, after case and punctuation normalisation, in the stated source (labels from the saved SPL XML, ISHLT pp. e64-e65 text with column positions checked, AASLD/AST and IATDMCT saved HTML, repo tree files). Every quoted string on the nodes and overlay was also matched against the same corpus (one cross-page sentence, D16, was matched in two parts).

Tiers: G = sourced sentence; GG = sourced sentence with a grade printed on that statement; APP = statement about an existing consult (file and line given, not a citation); SIL = checked absence. Editor notes are listed in section 2. Grades appear only where printed: ISHLT Class I, Level C on the statements named; AASLD/AST Strong, Level 3 on the AMR statement (TMA overlay only). Sources: P Prograf, A Astagraf XL, E Envarsus XR, N Neoral, G Gengraf, S Sandimmune, H ISHLT 2023 (heart recipients), L AASLD/AST 2024 graft complications, C IATDMCT 2019.

Counts: sourced (G/GG) claim rows on the three nodes = 11; sourced rows only in the overlay = 24; App content statements = 2; checked silences = 4; editor notes (distinct) = 5.

Word counts (body, links rendered as text, bullet marks excluded): tpe-pres 142; tpe-pres-seizure 146; tpe-pres-links 113; summary 43 words; recommendation 55 words.

